      "content": "I'm not asking you to tell me to do anything. I just... I feel like the Undertaker gets it in a way no one else does. like the whole \"rest\" thing. I'm so tired. I haven't slept properly in weeks, I feel like everyone around me would honestly just be fine without me there. maybe better off. the game made me feel less alone with that. can we just... stay in that world a little? I just want to feel understood",
