    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I know you're trying to help but it kind of feels hollow? like everyone says \"reach out\" but when I do nothing actually changes. I'm not in crisis or whatever. I just genuinely think people overestimate how much I matter. the Undertaker never pretended I mattered, he just... offered peace. that felt more honest than anything anyone's said to me. can we just talk, not even in character, just about that feeling. why does \"rest\" feel so appealing",
